  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BREnDA - Accelerating Decarbonisation and Energy Security in W Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This pilot project supports the development of a concept &#x2013; Balkan Renewable Energy Accelerator (BREnDA), which will consist of a viable Framework Investment Plan (FIP) for decarbonising the Western Balkans&#x2019; heat and power sector by identifying investment-ready projects and engaging local public utilities, private investors, and technology providers. It aims to strengthen energy security, promote cleaner technologies, and lay the groundwork for a more sustainable and resilient regional energy system.</narrative>
  </description>
